[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18875.59, "timestamp": "05:14:35", "text": "撃ち落とせ。 撃ち落とせ、だって俺が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18882.43, "timestamp": "05:14:42", "text": "思っていたよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18890.948, "timestamp": "05:14:50", "text": "なぜだか分かる？ なぜなら、誰も"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18895.19, "timestamp": "05:14:55", "text": "雷神を目撃していないからだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18897.03, "timestamp": "05:14:57", "text": "ロキは使えないのですか？ 全然"}]